    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48676" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηλύτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῆλυς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>womanhood, female nature</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				775a16
			</span></i>; <i>sexual characters</i> of the female, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				4.570
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>womanishness, delicacy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ θ. τοῦ κάλλους</span>
			<i>the womanish nature</i> of . . , ib. <i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>; also, <i>effeminacy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθήτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			 (pl.).</div>
